SF0037 Enhanced concealed carry in school zones.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Cooper, Anderson, Dockstader and Schuler
and Representative(s) Byron and Clouston
AN ACT relating to weapons; authorizing the issuance of enhanced concealed carry
permits; specifying requirements and conditions for the enhanced permits;
specifying places where enhanced concealed carry permittees may carry concealed
weapons; making conforming amendments; requiring rulemaking; and providing for
effective dates.
